28
00:01:58.049 --> 00:01:59.713
The thesis of this chapter.

29
00:01:59.993 --> 00:02:05.561
A relational database gives you powerful guarantees, but only the ones you actually ask for.

30
00:02:05.841 --> 00:02:17.084
Knowing what ACID, isolation levels, MVCC, locks and indexes really do is the difference between a system that is correct and fast, and one that is neither under load.

31
