00:11:04.425 --> 00:11:22.537
Seq Scan on orders (cost=0.00..48213.00 rows=11 width=96) (actual time=41.2..212.7. rows=9 loops=1).

196
00:11:22.817 --> 00:11:23.649
Filter:

197
00:11:23.929 --> 00:11:32.228
((customerid = 'cust-4242') AND (createdat = '2026 to 09 to 01')).

198
00:11:32.508 --> 00:11:34.172
Rows Removed by Filter:

199
00:11:34.452 --> 00:11:38.612
1999991.

200
00:11:38.892 --> 00:11:45.143
