00:34:05.721 --> 00:34:06.468
Note:

657
00:34:06.748 --> 00:34:13.788
What the system guarantees after this failure path. available never goes below zero (conditional update plus CHECK).

658
00:34:14.068 --> 00:34:23.689
A partially reservable order reserves nothing: the transaction rolls back and returns the unavailable SKUs so the app can offer substitutions.

659
00:34:23.969 --> 00:34:27.745
