1178
01:03:26.723 --> 01:03:31.992
Default 4.0 assumes spinning disks. checkpointtimeout or maxwalsize.

1179
01:03:32.272 --> 01:03:33.680
Typical starting point:

1180
01:03:33.960 --> 01:03:36.029
15 min or several GB.

