01:03:49.875 --> 01:03:51.283
Typical starting point:

1188
01:03:51.563 --> 01:03:54.038
80 to 90 for hot-update tables.

1189
01:03:54.318 --> 01:03:55.214
Guidance:

1190
01:03:55.494 --> 01:03:57.201
Enables HOT updates.

1191
01:03:57.481 --> 01:03:58.953
Autovacuum per table.

1192
01:03:59.233 --> 01:04:00.641
Typical starting point:

1193
01:04:00.921 --> 01:04:06.531
Scale factors ~0.01 to 0.05 on hot tables.

1194
01:04:06.811 --> 01:04:07.707
